  "description": "Andrew O'Connell is charming, smooth-talking servant at a grand Irish estate who prides himself on his ability to woo any woman. When the notoriously reclusive and shy Nora Greenwood arrives at the mansion as a guest, Andrew's friends throw down a challenge. Confident in his charms, Andrew wagers that he can easily seduce the quiet lady. It should have been an easy win, but when he finally gets Nora alone, he discovers that her \"timid\" reputation is a massive lie. Nora has a hidden side that is bold, demanding, and completely addictive. Andrew thought he was the player, but he’s about to find he’s just the prize.\n\n(Source: Lezhin US)\n\n*Note: Part of Lezhin's Sunaemul Danpyeonseon (순애물 단편선) Collection.*",
